      "message_parsed": "<b><span style=\"font-size: 22px\">TorrentPier Cattle. Версия 2.4.13</span></b><br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/6591/\" alt=\"Cattle.webp\" /><br />\n<br />\n<b>Ссылка:</b><br />\n<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/releases/tag/v2.4.13\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Release v2.4.13 · torrentpier/torrentpier</a><br />\n<br />\n<b>Чейнджлог:</b><br />\n<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/compare/v2.4.12...v2.4.13\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Comparing v2.4.12...v2.4.13 · torrentpier/torrentpier</a><br />\n<br />\n<h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-rocket-features\"></a>🚀 Features&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-rocket-features\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Bring back bb_exit() &amp; prn_r() functions (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2114\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2114</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/65c1b9c6821bbb96474ec79d02c7d5618b4fddb0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">65c1b9c</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-bug-bug-fixes\"></a>🐛 Bug Fixes&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-bug-bug-fixes\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(cookie)</i> Correct cookie value handling and add SameSite support (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2115\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2115</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/f89551ac18d0fc13cf9df64a75c9fbf6e4727cc5\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">f89551a</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(i18n)</i> Support deep merge for nested translation keys (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2111</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/98583faab9918baa4ad03d1a67e1ebe2640011ab\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">98583fa</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Prevent robots indexing for login &amp; registration pages (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2116\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2116</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/e98e66941a8b9b0a9e4b38c0ba4816b2793dcd4e\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">e98e669</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-gear-miscellaneous\"></a>⚙️ Miscellaneous&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-gear-miscellaneous\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(docker)</i> Fixed Caddyfile syntax (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2108\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2108</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/2cac35a21840b7d3fa17be651416b87fe3faec07\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">2cac35a</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-reverse-button-revert\"></a>◀️ Revert&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-reverse-button-revert\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Demo mode: Save user language in cookies (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2117\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2117</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/2061